{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Perfusion Assistant","role":"Clinical Perfusion Assistant","summary":"Qualification note: The direct pathway is generally B.Sc Perfusion Technology / B.Sc Cardiovascular Perfusion Technology / equivalent recognized Perfusion Technology programme. The broader Allied Health Sciences category is the database grouping. BPT, BOT and BMLT are not direct qualifications for clinical perfusion practice. The role of a Clinical Perfusion Assistant should be understood as a supervised cardiovascular-surgical support role; operating the heart-lung machine and making perfusion-management decisions requires appropriate professional qualification, training and institutional authorization.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Perfusion Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Clinical Perfusion Assistant works within the cardiovascular surgical team and supports the perfusionist during procedures that require extracorporeal circulation."},{"type":"p","text":"Perfusion technology is particularly important during:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open-heart surgery"},{"text":"Cardiopulmonary bypass"},{"text":"Valve surgery"},{"text":"Coronary artery bypass surgery"},{"text":"Congenital heart surgery"},{"text":"Major cardiovascular procedures"},{"text":"Selected extracorporeal life-support procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role requires a strong combination of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiovascular anatomy"},{"text":"Cardiopulmonary physiology"},{"text":"Blood physiology"},{"text":"Perfusion principles"},{"text":"Extracorporeal circulation"},{"text":"Biomedical equipment"},{"text":"Patient monitoring"},{"text":"Sterile technique"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The assistant works closely with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiovascular surgeons"},{"text":"Clinical perfusionists"},{"text":"Anaesthesiologists"},{"text":"Cardiac-care technologists"},{"text":"ICU teams"},{"text":"Nurses"},{"text":"Biomedical engineers"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Perfusion Technology education, cardiovascular physiology, extracorporeal circulation and supervised cardiac-surgery training"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Clinical Perfusion Assistant / supervised perfusion support, equipment preparation and cardiovascular-surgery exposure"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Qualified/senior perfusion professional pathway, advanced cardiopulmonary bypass and specialized extracorporeal support"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior perfusion practice, ECMO/ECLS specialization, clinical education, quality management or perfusion-service leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During Perfusion Technology Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Medical Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Pathology"},{"text":"Microbiology"},{"text":"Pharmacology fundamentals"},{"text":"Medical terminology"},{"text":"Basic physics"},{"text":"Patient care"},{"text":"Healthcare ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart chambers"},{"text":"Cardiac valves"},{"text":"Coronary circulation"},{"text":"Cardiac conduction"},{"text":"Systemic circulation"},{"text":"Pulmonary circulation"},{"text":"Blood pressure"},{"text":"Cardiac output"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Cardiopulmonary Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a deeper understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Physiology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiac output"},{"text":"Preload"},{"text":"Afterload"},{"text":"Contractility"},{"text":"Vascular resistance"},{"text":"Blood pressure"},{"text":"Oxygen delivery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Respiratory Physiology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ventilation"},{"text":"Gas exchange"},{"text":"Oxygenation"},{"text":"Carbon-dioxide removal"},{"text":"Acid-base balance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Blood Physiology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Haemoglobin"},{"text":"Oxygen carrying capacity"},{"text":"Coagulation"},{"text":"Blood loss"},{"text":"Haemodilution"},{"text":"Blood conservation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These concepts are essential because extracorporeal circulation temporarily supports functions normally performed by the heart and lungs."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Perfusion Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes the central specialization stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiopulmonary Bypass"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart-lung machine"},{"text":"Pump systems"},{"text":"Oxygenator"},{"text":"Heat exchanger"},{"text":"Reservoir"},{"text":"Arterial and venous circuits"},{"text":"Tubing"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Cardioplegia systems"},{"text":"Monitoring systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Simplified Circuit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient Venous Blood","Venous Cannula","Venous Reservoir","Pump","Oxygenator","Heat Exchanger","Arterial Filter","Arterial Cannula","Patient"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand the purpose, risks and monitoring requirements of every major component."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Clinical Perfusion Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should emphasize supervised cardiovascular-surgery exposure."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop Competence In"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perfusion-machine preparation"},{"text":"Circuit preparation"},{"text":"Equipment checks"},{"text":"Priming principles"},{"text":"Anticoagulation concepts"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Blood-gas analysis principles"},{"text":"Temperature management"},{"text":"Cardioplegia support"},{"text":"Blood conservation"},{"text":"Post-bypass equipment management"},{"text":"Documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical perfusion management must be performed by appropriately qualified professionals according to institutional protocols."},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiopulmonary Bypass Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Preoperative Preparation","Equipment & Circuit Check","Circuit Preparation","Patient Monitoring","Heparinization / ACT Verification","Cannulation","Initiation of Cardiopulmonary Bypass","Perfusion Monitoring","Temperature / Gas Management","Cardioplegia Support","Weaning From Bypass","Protamine / Anticoagulation Reversal Process","Post-Bypass Monitoring","Equipment Disassembly & Documentation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Perfusion Equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart-lung machines"},{"text":"Centrifugal pumps"},{"text":"Roller pumps"},{"text":"Oxygenators"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Reservoirs"},{"text":"Arterial filters"},{"text":"Cardioplegia delivery systems"},{"text":"Hemoconcentrators"},{"text":"Cell-salvage systems"},{"text":"Blood-gas monitoring"},{"text":"ACT monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Equipment Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pre-use checks"},{"text":"Alarm verification"},{"text":"Backup-system preparation"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Tubing inspection"},{"text":"Air detection"},{"text":"Pressure monitoring"},{"text":"Emergency equipment readiness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the importance of monitoring:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arterial pressure"},{"text":"Venous pressure"},{"text":"ECG"},{"text":"SpO₂"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Blood gases"},{"text":"Haemoglobin/haematocrit"},{"text":"Electrolytes"},{"text":"ACT"},{"text":"Oxygen delivery"},{"text":"Perfusion pressure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The perfusion team integrates these measurements with the surgical and anaesthesia teams to maintain safe extracorporeal support."},{"type":"h","text":"Anticoagulation & Blood Management"},{"type":"p","text":"A perfusion professional must understand the principles behind:"},{"type":"h","text":"Anticoagulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heparin"},{"text":"Activated clotting time"},{"text":"Anticoagulation monitoring"},{"text":"Reversal principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Blood Conservation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Haemodilution"},{"text":"Cell salvage"},{"text":"Ultrafiltration"},{"text":"Blood-component management"},{"text":"Minimizing circuit-related blood loss"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact management protocol is determined by the qualified clinical team and institutional policy."},{"type":"h","text":"Temperature Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hypothermia"},{"text":"Normothermia"},{"text":"Rewarming"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Temperature monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Temperature management can be particularly important during complex cardiac procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Cardioplegia"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the principles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Myocardial protection"},{"text":"Cardioplegia solutions"},{"text":"Delivery systems"},{"text":"Temperature considerations"},{"text":"Antegrade delivery"},{"text":"Retrograde delivery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The purpose is to understand how myocardial protection is integrated into cardiac surgery, rather than independently administering therapy outside the authorized scope."},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Preparedness"},{"type":"p","text":"The perfusion team must be prepared for equipment and patient emergencies."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the response principles for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air entering the circuit"},{"text":"Pump failure"},{"text":"Oxygenator failure"},{"text":"Power failure"},{"text":"Excessive bleeding"},{"text":"Abnormal pressures"},{"text":"Unexpected oxygenation problems"},{"text":"Severe hypotension"},{"text":"Equipment malfunction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Sequence"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recognize","Alert Perfusionist / Surgical Team","Activate Emergency Protocol","Switch to Backup System Where Directed","Support Patient Stabilization","Document Event","Equipment Investigation"]},{"type":"h","text":"ECMO & Extracorporeal Life Support"},{"type":"p","text":"An advanced perfusion pathway can lead toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECMO"},{"text":"ECLS"},{"text":"VA-ECMO"},{"text":"VV-ECMO"},{"text":"Extracorporeal support"},{"text":"Critical-care perfusion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should first build a strong cardiopulmonary-bypass foundation before pursuing advanced ECMO training."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology & Digital Perfusion"},{"type":"p","text":"Perfusion is a highly technology-intensive healthcare field."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital perfusion-monitoring systems"},{"text":"Patient monitoring"},{"text":"Blood-gas analyzers"},{"text":"ACT monitors"},{"text":"Temperature-management systems"},{"text":"Perfusion data recording"},{"text":"Electronic medical records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated perfusion systems"},{"text":"Remote monitoring"},{"text":"Smart heart-lung machines"},{"text":"Real-time perfusion analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted perfusion monitoring"},{"text":"Digital twin concepts"},{"text":"Predictive equipment maintenance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Perfusion generates large amounts of physiological and equipment data."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perfusion trend analysis"},{"text":"Oxygen-delivery monitoring"},{"text":"Predictive alerts"},{"text":"Equipment failure prediction"},{"text":"Perfusion-quality dashboards"},{"text":"Postoperative outcome research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"Biomedical data analysis"},{"text":"AI literacy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Perfusion Monitoring Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a research-oriented dashboard for anonymized perfusion data such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Flow"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Blood-gas parameters"},{"text":"ACT"},{"text":"Haematocrit"}]}]},{"heading":"Heart-Lung Machine Maintenance System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equipment maintenance"},{"text":"Calibration"},{"text":"Consumables"},{"text":"Service schedules"},{"text":"Fault history"}]}]},{"heading":"Cardiopulmonary Bypass Data Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze anonymized data to investigate relationships between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bypass duration"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Flow"},{"text":"Blood-gas values"},{"text":"Postoperative outcomes"}]}]},{"heading":"Perfusion Emergency Checklist System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a digital checklist covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pre-Bypass Checks","Circuit Verification","Monitoring","Emergency Equipment","Weaning From Bypass","Post-Procedure Checks"]}]},{"heading":"Smart Perfusion Technology Prototype","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a conceptual system integrating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Real-time monitoring"},{"text":"Equipment status"},{"text":"Perfusion records"},{"text":"Alert generation"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship & Clinical Training Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Cardiac Surgery Department"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open-heart procedures"},{"text":"Surgical workflow"},{"text":"Cardiopulmonary bypass"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Perfusion Department"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine preparation"},{"text":"Circuit preparation"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Equipment maintenance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Cardiac ICU"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Postoperative cardiac care"},{"text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"text":"Mechanical support"},{"text":"Critical-care workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. ECMO Centre"},{"type":"p","text":"Where available, gain supervised exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECMO circuits"},{"text":"Patient monitoring"},{"text":"Circuit management"},{"text":"Emergency protocols"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Blood-Management Services"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell salvage"},{"text":"Blood conservation"},{"text":"Blood-component management"},{"text":"Transfusion workflows"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on qualification, registration and employer requirements:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Perfusion Assistant"},{"text":"Perfusion Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiovascular Perfusion Technologist"},{"text":"Junior Perfusion Technologist"},{"text":"Cardiac Surgery Technologist"},{"text":"ECMO Technician/Technologist"},{"text":"Perfusion Equipment Specialist"},{"text":"Clinical Applications Specialist"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Titles such as Clinical Perfusionist generally require the specific recognized professional qualification and supervised clinical training required by the employer/regulatory framework. An assistant-level graduate should not be represented as an independently practising perfusionist without meeting those requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Cardiac Surgery Hospital"},{"text":"Cardiopulmonary bypass"}],[{"text":"Heart Institute"},{"text":"Perfusion + cardiac surgery"}],[{"text":"ECMO Centre"},{"text":"Extracorporeal support"}],[{"text":"Cardiac ICU"},{"text":"Critical-care monitoring"}],[{"text":"Medical College"},{"text":"Perfusion + research"}],[{"text":"Medical-Device Company"},{"text":"Heart-lung machines + equipment"}],[{"text":"Blood-Management Service"},{"text":"Cell salvage + blood conservation"}],[{"text":"Research Centre"},{"text":"Perfusion data + cardiovascular research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Clinical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic Life Support"},{"text":"CPR/AED"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Cardiac-care fundamentals"},{"text":"Perfusion technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiopulmonary bypass"},{"text":"ECMO fundamentals"},{"text":"Extracorporeal life support"},{"text":"Blood conservation"},{"text":"Patient blood management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart-lung machine technology"},{"text":"Biomedical equipment safety"},{"text":"Perfusion monitoring"},{"text":"Equipment troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize recognized perfusion education and supervised clinical competency over generic certificate accumulation."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible higher-study pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Perfusion Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Cardiovascular Perfusion"},{"text":"Master's in Cardiovascular Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Allied Health Sciences"},{"text":"Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Health Informatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Clinical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Perfusion Technology","Clinical Perfusion Experience","Advanced Perfusion Training","ECMO / ECLS Specialization","Senior Perfusion Professional"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Cardiopulmonary Bypass"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart-lung machine"},{"text":"Oxygenation"},{"text":"Flow management"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Cardioplegia"},{"text":"Blood management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. ECMO / ECLS"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VA-ECMO"},{"text":"VV-ECMO"},{"text":"Circuit management"},{"text":"Critical-care support"},{"text":"Emergency response"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Paediatric Perfusion"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop specialized knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neonatal physiology"},{"text":"Paediatric cardiac surgery"},{"text":"Small-volume circuits"},{"text":"Congenital heart disease"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Blood Conservation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell salvage"},{"text":"Hemoconcentration"},{"text":"Blood management"},{"text":"Transfusion reduction strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Perfusion Technology & Equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heart-lung machines"},{"text":"Oxygenators"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Monitoring systems"},{"text":"Automated perfusion technology"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Perfusion Technology Graduate","Clinical Perfusion Assistant","Qualified Perfusion Technologist / Perfusion Professional*","Senior Perfusion Professional","Specialized Perfusionist","ECMO / Advanced Perfusion Specialist","Perfusion Service Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"*Exact title and eligibility depend on the recognized qualification, registration requirements and employer/regulatory framework."},{"type":"h","text":"ECMO Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Perfusion Technology","Cardiac Surgery Experience","ECMO Training","ECMO Specialist","Senior ECMO / ECLS Professional","Extracorporeal Support Coordinator"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["Perfusion Professional","Clinical Equipment Experience","Perfusion Applications Specialist","Senior Applications Specialist","Cardiovascular Technology Manager","Perfusion Technology Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The future of perfusion is moving toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smart heart-lung machines"},{"text":"Automated perfusion control"},{"text":"Real-time oxygen-delivery monitoring"},{"text":"AI-assisted perfusion analytics"},{"text":"Digital perfusion records"},{"text":"Predictive equipment maintenance"},{"text":"Advanced ECMO systems"},{"text":"Portable ECMO technology"},{"text":"Miniaturized extracorporeal circuits"},{"text":"Advanced blood-conservation technology"},{"text":"Remote perfusion monitoring"},{"text":"Data-driven postoperative outcome analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong future profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Perfusion Technology","Cardiopulmonary Physiology","ECMO","Biomedical Equipment","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"CLINICAL PERFUSION ASSISTANT"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Cardiovascular Science"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cardiac Anatomy"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cardiovascular Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Respiratory Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Blood Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Perfusion"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cardiopulmonary Bypass"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Heart-Lung Machine"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Oxygenator"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Cardioplegia"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Blood Management"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Blood Gas"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── ACT"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Pressure"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Temperature"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Oxygen Delivery"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── ECMO"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── ECLS"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Paediatric Perfusion"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Critical Care"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Perfusion Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Equipment Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Digital Records"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── AI/Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Professional"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Sterile Technique"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Emergency Preparedness"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Multidisciplinary Teamwork"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong cardiovascular and respiratory physiology"},{"text":"Understanding of extracorporeal circulation"},{"text":"Thorough knowledge of cardiopulmonary bypass"},{"text":"Familiarity with heart-lung-machine components"},{"text":"Oxygenator and circuit knowledge"},{"text":"Cardioplegia principles"},{"text":"Blood-gas and ACT monitoring fundamentals"},{"text":"Temperature-management knowledge"},{"text":"Blood-conservation principles"},{"text":"Equipment safety and emergency preparedness"},{"text":"Exposure to cardiac surgery"},{"text":"Awareness of ECMO/ECLS"},{"text":"Strong sterile-technique knowledge"},{"text":"Clinical documentation skills"},{"text":"Basic healthcare data-analysis skills"},{"text":"Significant supervised perfusion clinical exposure"},{"text":"At least one perfusion-technology project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Perfusion Technology Degree","Cardiac Surgery Clinical Training","Clinical Perfusion Assistant","Qualified Perfusion Professional","Cardiopulmonary Bypass / ECMO Specialization","Senior Perfusion Professional","Advanced Perfusion / ECLS Leadership"]},{"type":"note","label":"Database mapping note","text":"Perfusion Technology → Clinical Perfusion Assistant is a logical entry-level mapping, but the database should distinguish Clinical Perfusion Assistant from Perfusionist/Clinical Perfusionist, because independent perfusion practice requires the appropriate recognized qualification, supervised clinical training and applicable professional authorization."}]}]}